{
 "title": "Empires",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Empires",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c057",
     "shot": "em_route",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "1540.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       0,
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c058",
     "shot": "em_route",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "A Spanish conquistador named Hernando de Soto marches",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c059",
     "shot": "em_route",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "into the region with hundreds of soldiers, horses,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c060",
     "shot": "em_route",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "war dogs, and a herd of pigs.",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "bleat",
       "w:pigs.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c061",
     "shot": "em_gold",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He is looking for gold.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c062",
     "shot": "em_gold",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He doesn't find *any.*",
     "date": null,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "boing",
       "w:any.",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c063",
     "shot": "em_chief",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In the middle of the region, he meets",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c064",
     "shot": "em_chief",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "a chief named Tascalusa.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c065",
     "shot": "em_chief",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Tall, proud, taller than any of the Spaniards,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c066",
     "shot": "em_chief",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "the chronicler said.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c067",
     "shot": "em_chief",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "De Soto takes him hostage and demands porters",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c068",
     "shot": "em_chief",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "and food.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c069",
     "shot": "em_follow",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Tascalusa says, fine, follow me.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "c070",
     "shot": "em_follow",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And he leads them to a walled town",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "wind"
    },
    {
     "id": "c071",
     "shot": "em_follow",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "called Mabila.",
     "date": null,
     "amb": "wind",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:Mabila.",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "c072",
     "shot": "em_mabila",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "October 18, 1540.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c073",
     "shot": "em_mabila",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Inside Mabila, warriors are waiting.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c074",
     "shot": "em_mabila",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The fighting lasts all day.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c075",
     "shot": "em_mabila",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The Spanish set the town on fire.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c076",
     "shot": "em_mabila",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Thousands of people died at Mabila.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c077",
     "shot": "em_mabila",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It was one of the bloodiest battles ever",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c078",
     "shot": "em_mabila",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "fought on North American soil.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c079",
     "shot": "em_unknown",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Nobody knows exactly where it happened.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c080",
     "shot": "em_unknown",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The town has never been found.",
     "date": null,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "c081",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "After that, Europe went quiet for 160 years.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c082",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then the French arrived.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c083",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "1702.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c084",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Two French brothers, Iberville and Bienville, build a",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c085",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "fort on the Mobile River.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c086",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "It is the capital of a colony called",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c087",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Louisiana, which in French dreams stretched from the",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c088",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Gulf to Canada.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c089",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And what is the very first thing they",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c090",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "do?",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c091",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "They throw a party.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c092",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "1703.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c093",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The settlers celebrate Mardi Gras, masks, feasts.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c094",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Within a few years, there's a society parading",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c095",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "a giant ox through the streets.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c096",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "New Orleans won't even be founded until 1718.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c097",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then Alabama's coast became a hot potato.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c098",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "France lost it to Britain in 1763.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c099",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Spain grabbed it in 1780.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c100",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And in 1813, in the middle of a",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c101",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "war with Britain, the United States marched in",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c102",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and took Mobile.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c103",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Four flags in 111 years.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c104",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Mobile changed owners more often than a rental",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c105",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "car.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c106",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But the real fight for Alabama was happening",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c107",
     "shot": "todo_empires",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "inland.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}